          "settings": {
            "text_position": "center",
            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Serving Colorado with Reliable Grass Seed for Lawns and Pastures Since 1989",
            "text": "<p>Finding the right seed mix for your lawn, pasture, or project in Colorado can be a challenge, especially with our dry climate and wide elevation ranges. Rivendell Distribution worked closely with landscapers, growers, and local farms who need dependable seed that actually grows strong in this region. </p><p>Our collection includes<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> custom seed mixes</a>,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Native+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> native grass</a>,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Turf+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> turf grass</a>, and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Wildflowers+%26+Grass+Seed\" target=\"_blank\"> specialty blends</a> selected to thrive across Colorado’s Western Slope<strong>.</strong> You’ll find options for everything from cover crops and forage to sun and shade blends for Colorado lawns. We keep our stock fresh, offer competitive pricing, and help you pick the seed mix that fits your land, your timing, and the way you want it to grow.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
            "bg_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
